WEBVTT

00:11.030 --> 00:15.780
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:11.030 --> 00:15.780
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:15.950 --> 00:20.200
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:15.950 --> 00:20.200
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:20.370 --> 00:24.000
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:20.370 --> 00:24.000
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:32.840 --> 00:36.180
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:32.840 --> 00:36.180
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:36.340 --> 00:39.100
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:36.340 --> 00:39.100
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:39.260 --> 00:41.640
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:39.260 --> 00:41.640
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:41.810 --> 00:44.940
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:41.810 --> 00:44.940
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:45.100 --> 00:49.320
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:45.100 --> 00:49.320
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:50.610 --> 00:54.820
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:50.610 --> 00:54.820
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:54.990 --> 00:59.160
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:54.990 --> 00:59.160
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:59.330 --> 01:04.500
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:59.330 --> 01:04.500
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

01:04.660 --> 01:09.500
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

01:04.660 --> 01:09.500
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

01:09.710 --> 01:13.670
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

01:09.710 --> 01:13.670
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

01:13.840 --> 01:17.720
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

01:13.840 --> 01:17.720
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

01:17.890 --> 01:22.810
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

01:17.890 --> 01:22.810
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

01:22.970 --> 01:27.770
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

01:22.970 --> 01:27.770
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

01:27.940 --> 01:31.520
<i>And dream my dream</i>

01:27.940 --> 01:31.520
<i>yume wo miru</i>

01:31.690 --> 01:33.860
<i>And know my dream</i>

01:31.690 --> 01:33.860
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

01:42.370 --> 01:50.540
THE INCIDENT AT THE FINALS

01:53.670 --> 01:55.220
Who the heck is that?

01:55.220 --> 01:56.380
Get him!

01:58.680 --> 02:01.570
So that's why you need
the Sword of Champions.

02:01.570 --> 02:04.850
Yeah. If you win this...

02:06.600 --> 02:10.610
Even if I win, I won't accept
the Sword of Champions.

02:10.610 --> 02:11.940
Huh?!

02:13.230 --> 02:17.240
I can't help you kill your own father!

02:18.650 --> 02:20.160
Maam...

02:20.160 --> 02:22.070
But...

02:23.120 --> 02:26.330
<i>And now, Gomez versus Chiu...</i>

02:26.660 --> 02:28.370
<i>Let the fight begin!</i>

02:33.210 --> 02:37.760
Baran may be the enemy,
but he's your long-lost father.

02:38.550 --> 02:42.890
If it's for defeating him, I don't want
you to have the Sword of Champions.

02:45.140 --> 02:48.270
Maam, the power of a Dragon Knight...

02:48.270 --> 02:52.270
It's a terrifying power
that could destroy the world.

02:52.730 --> 02:56.610
Baran's using that power
to wipe out humans.

02:56.610 --> 03:02.330
But Dai's been using that power for good.

03:02.330 --> 03:07.200
That's why I want Dai to have
a weapon that will let him face Baran!

03:11.330 --> 03:15.220
Maam, I don't want to defeat Baran.

03:15.220 --> 03:17.220
I want to show him.

03:17.220 --> 03:21.510
Unlike his ideal Dragon Knight,
being raised by Grampa,

03:21.510 --> 03:27.600
learning from Master Avan, and fighting
with everyone has made me far better.

03:27.600 --> 03:28.650
Dai...

03:28.650 --> 03:34.030
To do that, I need the Sword of Champions
to match his Demon Dragon Blade.

03:34.030 --> 03:39.230
If it ever looks like I'll use it for
the wrong reasons, you can punch me.

03:44.660 --> 03:46.030
All right, Dai.

03:48.870 --> 03:55.050
Hearing all this startled me, but
I promise I'll win the Sword of Champions!

03:55.050 --> 03:55.840
Maam!

03:55.840 --> 03:56.790
Hup!

03:57.340 --> 03:58.130
Right!

03:58.130 --> 03:59.340
Thanks!

04:03.510 --> 04:06.300
Okay! Let's go cheer on Chiu!

04:14.650 --> 04:15.350
Huh?

04:21.070 --> 04:22.580
Not bad there, lad.

04:22.580 --> 04:27.960
Grand Master and Maam are the only ones
I've ever struggled this much against!

04:27.960 --> 04:32.620
<i>But Grand Master and I are
the only ones you've ever sparred with.</i>

04:34.080 --> 04:36.800
Stop acting tough, you puny rat!

04:36.800 --> 04:39.680
Hah! Laugh while you still can!

04:39.680 --> 04:42.420
You'll regret it
once you see my killer attack!

04:42.760 --> 04:44.050
Oh! Here it comes!

04:44.050 --> 04:46.470
Chiu's boulder-busting killer attack!

04:46.470 --> 04:48.140
His killer attack?!

04:52.430 --> 04:54.560
Here goes!

04:55.350 --> 04:58.730
Rattus Fastus Fist!

05:03.110 --> 05:04.320
Whoa!

05:15.040 --> 05:19.080
<i>Two minutes five seconds!
The Wrestler Gomez wins by knockout!</i>

05:20.920 --> 05:21.630
Good going!

05:21.630 --> 05:22.590
Amazing!

05:24.630 --> 05:28.020
A boulder doesn't hit back after all.

05:28.020 --> 05:29.980
He's not very strong.

05:29.980 --> 05:32.010
He tries his best though.

05:32.970 --> 05:35.430
Oh. I get it now.

05:40.810 --> 05:43.360
Why was my killer move defeated?!

05:43.360 --> 05:47.490
Chiu, this is hard to say,
but I found out your weakness.

05:47.490 --> 05:50.410
Huh?! I don't have any weaknesses!

05:50.870 --> 05:53.210
Power, speed, technique... In all areas...

05:53.210 --> 05:56.000
You're a Fat Rat, so your limbs are short.

05:56.580 --> 05:58.340
<i>Your limbs are short...</i>

05:58.340 --> 05:59.670
<i>Short..</i>

05:59.670 --> 06:01.040
<i>You're a Fat Rat...</i>

06:01.460 --> 06:02.630
<i>You're a Fat Rat...</i>

06:02.630 --> 06:05.510
<i>Your limbs are short...</i>

06:05.710 --> 06:10.430
He lacks reach. That's a critical
weakness for a Martial Artist.

06:10.430 --> 06:12.600
His attacks can't reach his enemy.

06:12.600 --> 06:13.640
No!

06:15.390 --> 06:17.060
What's with him?

06:18.890 --> 06:21.060
<i>The victor is Baloria!</i>

06:23.650 --> 06:25.870
Listen, try to cheer up.

06:25.870 --> 06:27.240
Be quiet.

06:27.240 --> 06:32.540
I've just been given
a Martial Artist's death sentence.

06:32.540 --> 06:34.160
Don't try to cheer me up.

06:34.160 --> 06:36.040
Don't worry about it.

06:36.040 --> 06:39.670
You can always fight
with headbutts and ramming attacks.

06:39.670 --> 06:40.840
You've got the power.

06:40.840 --> 06:45.010
Do you think a hero who fights with
headbutts and ramming attacks is cool?

06:45.010 --> 06:46.510
Not really.

06:46.510 --> 06:47.600
H-Hey.

06:47.600 --> 06:49.470
I have to be cool!

06:49.970 --> 06:54.270
The only reason I entered this tournament
was to show how cool I am to Miss Maam!

06:54.270 --> 06:55.390
What?!

06:55.390 --> 06:58.360
You're awfully audacious for a monster!

06:58.360 --> 07:00.270
Hah! Love has no boundaries!

07:00.270 --> 07:01.650
Get real!

07:01.650 --> 07:03.070
You're a noisy one!

07:03.070 --> 07:05.990
I didn't like you the moment I saw you!

07:05.990 --> 07:06.910
What?!

07:06.910 --> 07:11.330
Ah-ha. I get it. You're Miss Maam's ex.

07:11.330 --> 07:12.660
Wha...?!

07:13.530 --> 07:16.330
I don't care about a woman's past.

07:16.330 --> 07:19.120
I don't know what happened
between you two, but...

07:19.460 --> 07:22.790
Here's two gold coins.
So forget about her, alright?

07:24.000 --> 07:27.590
Who taught you this stuff, you stupid rat!

07:27.590 --> 07:30.680
Why you...! You dare raise a hand
against a Martial Artist?!

07:30.680 --> 07:32.090
You'll regret that!

07:39.730 --> 07:42.980
Hmph! I'll let you off the hook
with that for today.

07:42.980 --> 07:44.860
Oh boy...

07:45.900 --> 07:48.320
We've made a weird friend today.

07:49.610 --> 07:51.200
It's Miss Maam's turn!

07:55.870 --> 07:59.700
Miss Maam! Do your best for me!

08:00.410 --> 08:02.830
<i>Let the fight begin!</i>

08:07.000 --> 08:09.760
-Good going, Maam!
-Miss Maam!

08:09.760 --> 08:10.840
Wow.

08:28.520 --> 08:33.990
<i>The Romos Martial Arts Tournament
has found its best eight fighters!</i>

08:34.280 --> 08:39.450
<i>Let us introduce the eight fighters
who are the pride of this country!</i>

08:39.740 --> 08:43.460
<i>First is the top contender to win!</i>

08:43.460 --> 08:45.960
<i>The Warrior of unmatched strength, Larba!</i>

08:45.960 --> 08:47.800
-Larba!
-Win!

08:47.800 --> 08:51.510
<i>Next is the Omni-whip master, Stangul!</i>

08:51.510 --> 08:53.390
Sir Stangul!

08:53.390 --> 08:57.560
<i>The mighty spell-wielding Mage, Fobster!</i>

08:57.560 --> 08:58.720
Amazing!

08:59.050 --> 09:02.980
<i>The hunter who never misses, Hilto!</i>

09:03.430 --> 09:06.820
<i>They're all equally matched
mighty warriors!</i>

09:06.820 --> 09:11.610
<i>Next, with both power
and wrestling technique,</i>

09:11.610 --> 09:13.910
<i>it's Wrestler Gomez!</i>

09:13.910 --> 09:14.700
Right!

09:15.070 --> 09:19.200
<i>The Knight with
the gale wind sword, Baloria!</i>

09:19.660 --> 09:22.710
<i>Is he strong or is he weak?!</i>

09:22.710 --> 09:25.790
<i>The mysterious figure, Mr. Ghost!</i>

09:26.120 --> 09:31.800
<i>And the only female contestant,
the Martial Artist Maam!</i>

09:32.840 --> 09:33.930
So cute!

09:33.930 --> 09:35.140
Good luck!

09:35.140 --> 09:36.970
Good luck!

09:37.630 --> 09:39.390
She's pretty popular.

09:39.390 --> 09:43.440
<i>These eight will compete in the finals!</i>

09:43.440 --> 09:46.860
<i>Just who will win?!</i>

09:46.860 --> 09:51.570
<i>Just who will claim
the Sword of Champions?!</i>

09:53.730 --> 09:55.820
So that's the Sword of Champions!

09:55.820 --> 09:56.780
That one?!

09:56.780 --> 09:59.200
Wow. I'll be winning that.

09:59.200 --> 10:03.000
You can't even use it. I'll be winning it.

10:03.000 --> 10:05.880
Don't bet on it. I can just sell it.

10:05.880 --> 10:08.420
It'll be worth an unbelievable amount.

10:08.420 --> 10:12.010
<i>I won't let anyone have it!
That sword is for Dai!</i>

10:12.010 --> 10:14.130
<i>It's going to be used for good!</i>

10:17.220 --> 10:22.850
So Maam entered the tournament.
This will be interesting.

10:23.220 --> 10:24.350
Hm?

10:24.350 --> 10:25.650
Where's Mister Zamza?

10:25.650 --> 10:26.770
Right there!

10:29.100 --> 10:32.490
<i>And now, the host
of this tournament, Mister Zamza,</i>

10:32.490 --> 10:36.110
<i>will explain the rules of the finals!</i>

10:42.620 --> 10:47.590
Huh. So this Martial Arts Tournament
wasn't the king's idea.

10:47.590 --> 10:49.250
I wonder who he is.

10:49.500 --> 10:52.630
All of you have fought well.

10:52.960 --> 10:57.210
With such members,
I am immensely satisfied.

10:57.720 --> 11:03.520
It was worth suggesting this tournament
to the king and hosting it.

11:03.520 --> 11:07.600
Such a wonderful gathering
of promising samples!

11:08.350 --> 11:13.360
You eight shall be the base
for the future Dark Army!

11:16.070 --> 11:17.950
What kind of joke is this?!

11:17.950 --> 11:20.400
Playtime is over!

11:21.700 --> 11:23.370
W-What?!

11:37.170 --> 11:39.760
Mister Zamza,
what is the meaning of this?!

11:39.760 --> 11:42.680
Thank you for your help, King Romos.

11:42.680 --> 11:46.060
This will help our Dark Army greatly.

11:46.060 --> 11:47.220
Who are you?!

11:53.650 --> 11:57.530
The Dark Army's Mystic Legion Commander
Zaboera's son...

11:57.530 --> 12:00.940
the Mystic Scholar Zamza!

12:03.990 --> 12:06.490
AVAN STRASH

12:08.990 --> 12:11.500
DARK INCENSE

12:12.290 --> 12:16.220
The Dark Army's Mystic Legion Commander
Zaboera's son...

12:16.220 --> 12:19.670
the Mystic Scholar Zamza!

12:20.050 --> 12:22.340
A-A Darkling?!

12:27.550 --> 12:29.560
The Mystic Scholar Zamza?!

12:29.560 --> 12:31.600
Zaboera's son?!

12:33.640 --> 12:35.990
We've been captured by the Dark Army?!

12:35.990 --> 12:37.020
What?!

12:37.440 --> 12:42.490
For our Mystic Legion's
Superior Being Studies experiments,

12:42.490 --> 12:46.620
we require humans with strong bodies.

12:47.830 --> 12:51.290
So I used you to hold
this Martial Arts Tournament!

12:51.830 --> 12:56.340
Plus, I can remove humans who can
resist the Dark Army from Romos!

12:56.340 --> 12:59.170
Truly killing two birds with one stone!

12:59.170 --> 13:02.430
Curse you! How dare you deceive me?!

13:02.430 --> 13:06.720
It's too late! These eight are mine!

13:06.720 --> 13:12.430
And if I can take your life, King Romos,
then that's even better!

13:13.060 --> 13:14.600
Die!

13:21.610 --> 13:22.320
Huh?!

13:24.650 --> 13:26.290
Dai! Popp!

13:26.290 --> 13:29.040
We won't let the Dark Army
get away with this!

13:29.040 --> 13:30.460
Did he say "Dai"?!

13:30.460 --> 13:32.000
Popp, protect His Majesty!

13:32.000 --> 13:34.000
Right! I got this!

13:34.500 --> 13:36.120
I'm your opponent!

13:36.540 --> 13:38.510
<i>Dai, the Hero...</i>

13:38.510 --> 13:44.050
<i>It could be that my two birds
have become three.</i>

13:44.050 --> 13:46.760
<i>It's the Dark Army! Everybody run!</i>

13:49.350 --> 13:51.640
Dammit! Are you kidding me?!

13:51.640 --> 13:53.970
I'm not letting the Dark Army capture me!

14:00.360 --> 14:01.400
It won't cut?!

14:02.270 --> 14:03.690
Magic doesn't work either!

14:04.280 --> 14:06.030
This isn't a normal cage!

14:11.370 --> 14:13.540
This cage is alive.

14:13.540 --> 14:16.120
What?! It's a creature?!

14:16.370 --> 14:18.460
Miss Maam!

14:19.170 --> 14:20.830
Dammit! Come on!

14:23.050 --> 14:24.210
What are you doing?!

14:28.930 --> 14:32.510
Get your filthy hands off my Bioprison!

14:32.850 --> 14:34.600
You gutter rat!

14:34.600 --> 14:38.270
I'm not a gutter rat! I'm a Karate...!

14:38.270 --> 14:41.810
You won't even make
a good guinea pig! Begone!

14:42.610 --> 14:44.410
Stop!

14:44.410 --> 14:45.570
You little whelp!

14:53.530 --> 14:54.410
<i>So this...</i>

14:54.990 --> 14:57.450
<i>So this is the power of a Dragon Knight?!</i>

14:57.750 --> 15:00.000
Chiu, Gomechan, go to Popp!

15:00.000 --> 15:02.340
What?! Why do I have to...?!

15:02.340 --> 15:05.710
Ow, ow, ow! I get it! I get it!

15:06.260 --> 15:09.590
Let Maam and the others go!
If you don't, you'll regret it!

15:20.230 --> 15:22.740
Amazing! Magnificent!

15:22.740 --> 15:27.860
So this is the power of a real...
A real Dragon Knight!

15:29.530 --> 15:31.080
What's so funny?!

15:31.080 --> 15:34.160
It's not funny, it's joyous!

15:34.160 --> 15:37.500
Your appearance surprised me at first,

15:37.500 --> 15:42.880
but to see a real Dragon Knight is the
most blessed surprise I could hope for!

15:42.880 --> 15:48.420
The purpose of our research is to reach
a Dragon Knight's power after all!

15:48.760 --> 15:50.220
A Dragon Knight's...?!

15:54.010 --> 15:57.770
The Mystic Legion leads
other Legions in Magic Power,

15:57.770 --> 15:59.770
but we lack strength and vitality!

15:59.770 --> 16:05.860
So I've been researching in secret on my
father Zaboera's idea to make up for that!

16:06.520 --> 16:08.900
That's the Superior Being Studies!

16:11.240 --> 16:13.910
Superior Being Studies?!

16:13.910 --> 16:17.240
A Superior Being, in other words,
one that transcends Darklings!

16:18.410 --> 16:22.880
<i>By surgically transplanting
the strengths of various monsters,</i>

16:22.880 --> 16:27.960
<i>we've come up with the idea
to artificially create Superior Beings!</i>

16:28.710 --> 16:35.020
And when your father Baran took
his Dragonoid form, we were convinced!

16:35.020 --> 16:40.270
This is it! This is the goal of
our Superior Being Studies!

16:41.270 --> 16:47.030
A being that could only be called
the ultimate bioweapon made by the gods!

16:47.030 --> 16:51.780
A weapon?!

16:54.570 --> 16:57.240
For that, we require test subjects.

16:57.620 --> 16:59.490
That what they are.

17:00.910 --> 17:06.260
We can't sacrifice our Darkling servants
for every experiment.

17:06.260 --> 17:12.340
Strong humans make the perfect
disposable guinea pigs!

17:12.340 --> 17:14.550
I won't let you do that!

17:15.510 --> 17:18.600
Then you'll have to get angry and fight!

17:18.600 --> 17:23.730
I want to see it!
The full power that you possess!

17:23.730 --> 17:30.530
You can't resist a fight. You're like
a moth to a flame! The perfect sample!

17:30.530 --> 17:35.120
A sample for making
a monster like your father!

17:35.120 --> 17:39.990
Sh-Shut up!

17:46.920 --> 17:49.960
Wow! No wonder he's called the Hero!

18:11.150 --> 18:15.410
What power! Dai has grown so strong!

18:15.410 --> 18:18.240
He's truly a Hero! His victory is assured!

18:18.610 --> 18:21.460
<i>Don't lose your head
and waste all your energy, Dai!</i>

18:21.460 --> 18:24.120
<i>He's hiding something!</i>

18:24.120 --> 18:29.830
<i>I can win! If this is his best,
my Superior Being...</i>

18:44.350 --> 18:46.190
Mighty Hero, now's your chance!

18:46.190 --> 18:48.440
Finish him off!

18:48.440 --> 18:49.850
Something's wrong!

18:50.480 --> 18:53.990
At full strength,
Dai's Dragon power can shatter mountains.

18:53.990 --> 18:56.610
It's destructive enough
to split the earth!

18:57.360 --> 19:00.870
Sure, Darklings
are more powerful than humans,

19:00.870 --> 19:03.540
but there's no way they can take that!

19:03.540 --> 19:07.960
And yet, while he's getting wounded,
he doesn't seem close to falling!

19:08.500 --> 19:10.870
I think Dai's noticed that, too!

19:15.420 --> 19:19.130
What's wrong? Is seeing
your first real fight freaking you out?

19:19.760 --> 19:22.060
Don't be stupid! I'm not freaking out!

19:22.060 --> 19:28.640
I don't know why, but seeing that guy
makes my tail tremble for some reason!

19:30.600 --> 19:36.780
You must be wondering why you can't
shatter the body of a mere Darkling!

19:36.780 --> 19:39.740
Care to guess why?

19:40.360 --> 19:42.700
<i>I'll finish him in one shot...</i>

19:42.700 --> 19:44.530
<i>with that attack!</i>

19:50.290 --> 19:51.750
Crest Beam!

19:54.590 --> 19:57.960
Nice! That's a Dragon Knight's
killer move!

20:10.560 --> 20:16.530
It appears with a Superior Being's powers,
a Dragon Knight can be defeated!

20:16.530 --> 20:18.950
Are you saying he's already...?!

20:18.950 --> 20:24.700
Correct! Superior Beings
are already 90% complete!

20:24.700 --> 20:28.080
Since I used my own body as the base!

20:28.660 --> 20:32.290
You've shown me
the power of a Dragon Knight!

20:32.830 --> 20:35.210
Now it's your turn to see!

20:35.210 --> 20:41.130
With the strengths of over
a hundred monsters combined...

20:44.390 --> 20:49.970
the power of the ultimate Superior Being!

21:10.080 --> 21:13.500
This is a Superior Being?!

21:17.750 --> 21:21.180
Something strange is going on outside.

21:21.180 --> 21:22.460
Dai!

21:25.720 --> 21:28.800
<i>No wonder Chiu's instinctively terrified.</i>

21:29.390 --> 21:33.560
<i>That thing really is
the sum of all monsters!</i>

21:34.440 --> 21:37.600
Come on, Dai!

21:38.480 --> 21:39.950
I've chosen you

21:39.950 --> 21:46.820
to have the honor of being
the Superior Being Zamza's first opponent!

21:47.360 --> 21:50.530
You should be grateful!

22:04.340 --> 22:07.300
<i>Even if you face the devil
With logic on your side</i>

22:04.340 --> 22:07.300
<i>tatoe akuma ni seiron kazashite
mukatte mitemo</i>

22:07.470 --> 22:11.260
<i>It may just be a rationalization</i>

22:07.470 --> 22:11.260
<i>sore wa akumade seitouka
sashite chigai wa naikamo</i>

22:11.430 --> 22:15.350
<i>Even now, even now I waver</i>

22:11.430 --> 22:15.350
<i>ima mo ima mo yureteiru kedo</i>

22:15.520 --> 22:19.400
<i>How far will we go?</i>

22:15.520 --> 22:19.400
<i>bokura wa dokomade yukuno</i>

22:19.560 --> 22:22.690
<i>I heard a voice like an angel's whisper</i>

22:19.560 --> 22:22.690
<i>tenshi no sasayaki nimo nita
koe ga kikoeta</i>

22:22.860 --> 22:26.610
<i>Maybe it was an imposter's illusion
It still rang in my ears</i>

22:22.860 --> 22:26.610
<i>hatamata petenshi no mayakashi
hitokiwa mimi ni hibiiteita</i>

22:26.780 --> 22:30.320
<i>ai ni hiai ni sarasare nagara</i>

22:26.780 --> 22:30.320
<i>Exposed to love and sorrow</i>

22:30.490 --> 22:34.620
<i>hokori mamire michi no tochu</i>

22:30.490 --> 22:34.620
<i>On the path strewn with pride</i>

22:36.330 --> 22:38.670
<i>kiete wa ukabu touhikou</i>

22:36.330 --> 22:38.670
<i>Fleeting moments of cowardice</i>

22:40.210 --> 22:42.460
<i>nomikonda SOS</i>

22:40.210 --> 22:42.460
<i>The SOS I held back</i>

22:44.050 --> 22:48.050
<i>furueru te wo nigirishimeta</i>

22:44.050 --> 22:48.050
<i>I clenched my trembling fist</i>

22:48.630 --> 22:53.640
<i>tatta hitotsu no chiisana yakusoku ga</i>

22:48.630 --> 22:53.640
<i>That single little promise</i>

22:53.810 --> 22:57.430
<i>honno sasaina omoidetachi ga</i>

22:53.810 --> 22:57.430
<i>Those trivial little memories</i>

22:57.600 --> 22:59.730
<i>itsumade tattemo kono mune wo</i>

22:57.600 --> 22:59.730
<i>They're still in my heart</i>

22:59.900 --> 23:03.900
<i>kogashi tsuzukeru tomoshibi ni naru</i>

22:59.900 --> 23:03.900
<i>As embers that keep me burning</i>

23:04.070 --> 23:08.400
<i>tada hitosuji no toumei na hikari ga</i>

23:04.070 --> 23:08.400
<i>A single transparent beam of light</i>

23:08.570 --> 23:11.570
<i>me no mae wo terashite yuku</i>

23:08.570 --> 23:11.570
<i>Lights the way before me</i>

23:11.740 --> 23:16.250
<i>boku ni dekiru koto wa ikutsu mo naisa</i>

23:11.740 --> 23:16.250
<i>There is little that I can do</i>

23:16.410 --> 23:22.460
<i>shinjinuita saki ni te ni shita mirai wo
susunde yuke</i>

23:16.410 --> 23:22.460
<i>Just keep on to the future
I managed to grasp through my faith</i>

23:33.970 --> 23:39.020
<i>As Zamza becomes a Superior Being, Dai
fights with the full power of his crest.</i>

23:39.180 --> 23:42.860
<i>But his stamina depletes too quickly.</i>

23:43.020 --> 23:47.280
<i>Popp fights as well, but against a being
that surpasses even a Dragon Knight,</i>

23:47.440 --> 23:48.820
<i>there's nothing he can do.</i>

23:48.990 --> 23:53.120
<i>With Dai and friends in peril,
Maam's senior pupil, Chiu, stands up.</i>

23:53.490 --> 23:55.660
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

23:55.830 --> 23:57.540
<i>"The Superior Being Versus Chiu"</i>

23:57.700 --> 23:59.710
<i>The adventure continues!</i>

23:59.710 --> 24:01.710


24:01.710 --> 24:03.690

